# ============================================================
# LIMS backend-new (.NET 8.0) - Git Ignore
# ============================================================
# 注：本文件位于 backend-new/ 目录内
# 路径以 .gitignore 所在目录为根(即为 backend-new/),无需前缀
# 根目录 .gitignore 的 backend/*/bin/ 不会匹配 backend-new(因带 -new)

# --- Build 输出 ---
/bin/
/obj/
/out/
/publish/
/Artifacts/
/TestResults/
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/out/
**/publish/
**/publish-*/
**/Artifacts/
**/TestResults/

# --- 自包含部署 / 单文件发布产物 ---
*.deps.json
*.runtimeconfig.json
*.runtimeconfig.dev.json
**/apphost.exe
**/apphost

# --- Rider / ReSharper ---
_ReSharper*/
*.[Rr]e[Ss]harper
**/.idea/
*.DotSettings.user
*.sln.DotSettings.user

# --- VS Code ---
/.vscode/
**/.vscode/

# --- Visual Studio 解决方案用户选项 ---
*.suo
*.user
*.userprefs
*.lock.json
*.swp

# --- NuGet ---
*.nupkg
*.snupkg
**/packages/
**/project.assets.json
**/project.fragment.lock.json

# --- 单元测试结果 ---
coverage*.json
coverage*.xml
coverage*.info

# --- SQLite 数据库(运行时生成) ---
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3

# --- 调试日志(本次调试 session 产物) ---
debug-*.log

# --- appsettings 本地覆盖 ---
# 保留 appsettings.json 入库
# 忽略本地开发覆盖
**/appsettings.Development.json
**/appsettings.Local.json

# --- 临时文件 ---
**/tmp/
**/temp/
*.tmp
*.bak
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db

# --- 生成的文档产物(若用工具自动生成) ---
**/wwwroot/dist/

# --- EF Core Migrations 备份(可选) ---
# 默认不忽略,保留迁移;若要忽略请取消下一行注释
# **/Migrations/*Snapshot*
